# The Plasma appletsrc carries panel layout and applet config worth tracking,
# but KDE writes the *current* wallpaper path into it too -- and the slideshow
# rotates every SlideInterval (30 min here), so the file is otherwise dirty
# permanently and leaks local wallpaper paths into this public repo.
#
# The kde-wallpaper filter strips Image=/SlidePaths= on the way into git and
# puts them back on the way out, from an untracked per-machine sidecar, so the
# working copy keeps its wallpaper and the blob never sees it. Implementation
# and the history of why the restoring half is not optional:
# scripts/kde-wallpaper-filter.sh. Configured per-clone by install.sh
# (git_settings); a clone that skips it just commits the lines again, which is
# why it lives there and not only here.
os/endeavour/config/plasma-org.kde.plasma.desktop-appletsrc filter=kde-wallpaper
